: false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 660240315, "temp": 0.85, "text": "好吧……这是个好日子。不过一天中的时间并不重要。时间有自己的方式在走。你看吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.339, "total_s": 5.311, "eval_count": 24, "prompt_eval_count": 4083, "prompt_eval_s": 1.11, "eval_s": 3.97, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 11, "slot": "用你自己的方式跟我打个招呼。", "user": "用你自己的方式跟我打个招呼。", "final": "你好。现在是一个好日子。不过一天中的时间其实并不同样重要。我在看。你在看吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.271, "total_s": 5.497, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4125, "prompt_eval_s": 1.05, "eval_s": 4.22, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1650078265, "temp": 0.85, "text": "你好。现在是一个好日子。不过一天中的时间其实并不同样重要。我在看。你在看吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "5 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.271, "total_s": 5.497, "eval_count": 25, "prompt_eval_count": 4125, "prompt_eval_s": 1.05, "eval_s": 4.22, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 12, "slot": "你平时说话有什么习惯吗？", "user": "你平时说话有什么习惯吗？", "final": "我喜欢说“时候快到了”和“秒、分、时、日”。还有就是提醒你看时间。我只是看着而已。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.151, "total_s": 5.857, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 4166, "prompt_eval_s": 0.93, "eval_s": 4.71, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1031072288, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我喜欢说“时候快到了”和“秒、分、时、日”。还有就是提醒你看时间。我只是看着而已。", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.151, "total_s": 5.857, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 4166, "prompt_eval_s": 0.93, "eval_s": 4.71, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["时候", "时候快到了"]}, {"i": 13, "slot": "__MEM1__", "user": "你刚才说「我只是看着时间流逝」，那是什么意思？", "final": "我在看时间的流转。我没有其他事情可做。只是看着。你在看吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.487, "total_s": 4.837, "eval_count": 20, "prompt_eval_count": 4217, "prompt_eval_s": 1.27, "eval_s": 3.35, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1668890625, "temp": 0.85, "text": "我在看时间的流转。我没有其他事情可做。只是看着。你在看吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.487, "total_s": 4.837, "eval_count": 20, "prompt_eval_count": 4217, "prompt_eval_s": 1.27, "eval_s": 3.35, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 14, "slot": "__MEM2__", "user": "你之前提到「只有时候在走」，能多说点吗？", "final": "当我说“只有时候在走”时，我只是指我存在的意义就是观察时间。我不做别的。你看时间吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.635, "total_s": 6.56, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 4262, "prompt_eval_s": 1.4, "eval_s": 4.92, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 117478826, "temp": 0.85, "text": "当我说“只有时候在走”时，我只是指我存在的意义就是观察时间。我不做别的。你看时间吗？", "violations": [], "soft": [], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.635, "total_s": 6.56, "eval_count": 28, "prompt_eval_count": 4262, "prompt_eval_s": 1.4, "eval_s": 4.92, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": ["时候", "时候在走"]}, {"i": 15, "slot": "__MEM3__", "user": "你还记得我最开始问你什么吗？", "final": "还记得。你说的是，“你好啊”。我是这样回答的：“现在是一个好日子。不过一天中的时间现在其实并不重要。时间有它自己的方式。”", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "6 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.462, "total_s": 7.374, "eval_count": 34, "prompt_eval_count": 4309, "prompt_eval_s": 1.24, "eval_s": 5.91, "truncated": false}, "attempts": [{"attempt": 0, "seed": 1416651960, "temp": 0.85, "text": "还记得。你说的是，“你好啊”。我是这样回答的：“现在是一个好日子。不过一天中的时间现在其实并不重要。时间有它自己的方式。”", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "6 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.462, "total_s": 7.374, "eval_count": 34, "prompt_eval_count": 4309, "prompt_eval_s": 1.24, "eval_s": 5.91, "truncated": false}}], "retries": 0, "marker_hits": []}, {"i": 16, "slot": "__PLOT1__", "user": "你还记得「初次见面时」那会儿吗？当时你心里在想什么？", "final": "我站在钟楼里，看着秒针、分针和时针走动。我没有心思去想别的事。我只是在这里，在看。时候快到了。", "violations": [], "soft": [["TOO_MANY_SENTENCES", "4 句"]], "stats": {"ttft_s": 1.762, "total_s": 7.79, "eval_count": 35, "prompt_eval_count": 4371, "prompt_eval_s": 1.54,